method.description:
Returns all command-line arguments passed after [code]--[/code] that were not consumed by [VGAMasterNode] (i.e. everything except [code]ipc_name[/code], [code]num_envs[/code], [code]obs_width[/code], [code]obs_height[/code], [code]obs_channels[/code], [code]step_rate_hz[/code], and [code]real_time_mode[/code]). Arguments must be in [code]key=value[/code] format; malformed entries are ignored. Values are always strings — cast as needed.
[codeblock]
var args = $VGAMasterNode.get_user_args()
var scenario = args.get("scenario", "id")
[/codeblock]
